WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.540
- We're showing love to LA this week.

00:00:01.540 --> 00:00:03.260
So what do you love about Los Angeles?

00:00:03.260 --> 00:00:04.093
What are your favorite parts?

00:00:04.093 --> 00:00:05.740
- Oh, well I'm lucky.

00:00:05.740 --> 00:00:07.530
So, Zooey was born and raised here,

00:00:07.530 --> 00:00:09.170
and so she has shown me a whole side

00:00:09.170 --> 00:00:11.180
of LA that I didn't know about.

00:00:11.180 --> 00:00:12.930
- Yeah. That's helpful.
- And I love it. Yeah.

00:00:12.930 --> 00:00:15.040
But I think probably for us,

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:17.100
the number one thing that we love:

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:18.650
so many escape rooms in LA.

00:00:18.650 --> 00:00:20.250
- Oh my God, I love escape rooms.

00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:21.083
- Are you into escape rooms?

00:00:21.083 --> 00:00:23.300
- I love escape rooms. Here's the thing.

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:25.580
My assistant kicks my ass at them.

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:26.870
She's so good at them.

00:00:26.870 --> 00:00:27.920
But I love them.

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.140
- So, if we go together, we
want her on our team, not you.

00:00:30.140 --> 00:00:31.500
- No! Yes. But, no!

00:00:33.560 --> 00:00:34.393
- We love them.

00:00:34.393 --> 00:00:35.690
We've done them all over the world.

00:00:35.690 --> 00:00:36.530
- We've done them on tour.

00:00:36.530 --> 00:00:39.422
We did them all on tour.
Like, yeah, we love them.

00:00:39.422 --> 00:00:40.255
They're so fun.

00:00:40.255 --> 00:00:42.010
Have you done them?

00:00:42.010 --> 00:00:43.290
- An escape room, you mean my audition

00:00:43.290 --> 00:00:44.704
with Harvey Weinstein 10 years ago?

00:00:44.704 --> 00:00:46.196
(Kelly laughs)
(audience cheering)

00:00:46.196 --> 00:00:47.563
- [Jonathan] Did you escape?
(Whitney laughs)

00:00:47.563 --> 00:00:48.540
- I mean.

00:00:48.540 --> 00:00:49.670
- Did you make it?

00:00:51.230 --> 00:00:53.270
- I've been an actress in
Hollywood for 10 years.

00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:54.813
Every room is an escape room.

00:00:55.669 --> 00:00:58.130
- Actually, we heard about the
door, leaving the door open.

00:00:58.130 --> 00:00:59.718
So she saw that escape room.

00:00:59.718 --> 00:01:00.551
- She's safe, she's safe.

00:01:00.551 --> 00:01:01.384
What do you love about LA?

00:01:01.384 --> 00:01:03.124
Was that one of your favorite things?

00:01:03.124 --> 00:01:04.200
- Yeah, I mean, escape rooms, for me--

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:05.870
Magic Castle is actually--
I just went again

00:01:05.870 --> 00:01:06.703
with our nieces and nephews.

00:01:06.703 --> 00:01:07.536
They have a brunch too.

00:01:07.536 --> 00:01:08.369
So you get a little magic,

00:01:08.369 --> 00:01:10.066
you get some lunch, which was always fun.

00:01:10.066 --> 00:01:11.210
- [Kelly] That's cool

00:01:11.210 --> 00:01:12.770
- Yeah. I mean, there's
so many great things.

00:01:12.770 --> 00:01:15.135
Just going around the city of Linden.

00:01:15.135 --> 00:01:15.990
I create little date days.

00:01:15.990 --> 00:01:18.970
Even during COVID we were
like, in our car for picnics.

00:01:18.970 --> 00:01:20.090
And then we would go to like,

00:01:20.090 --> 00:01:22.520
an abandoned part of a parking lot

00:01:22.520 --> 00:01:23.410
and throw a Frisbee around.

00:01:23.410 --> 00:01:25.510
But it's-- going up into the Hills,

00:01:25.510 --> 00:01:26.343
wherever we are.

00:01:26.343 --> 00:01:27.330
- [Whitney] A Frisbee? You play Frisbee?

00:01:27.330 --> 00:01:29.830
- I love-- it's called disc
golf, if you're this good.

00:01:29.830 --> 00:01:31.485
Anybody play disc golf?

00:01:31.485 --> 00:01:32.527
(Whitney blowing raspberries)
- [Kelly] If you're this good!

00:01:32.527 --> 00:01:33.617
- I'm sorry.
- I love it!

00:01:33.617 --> 00:01:34.860
- Let me just point something out,

00:01:34.860 --> 00:01:36.210
for anyone who doesn't know.

00:01:36.210 --> 00:01:39.540
Drew is the most competitive man alive.

00:01:39.540 --> 00:01:41.040
- Welcome to your counterpart.

00:01:42.520 --> 00:01:44.976
- You're the two people
that ruin game night.

00:01:44.976 --> 00:01:47.163
- No! We make it fun!
- Every one of my friends,

00:01:47.163 --> 00:01:48.670
at some point, has been yelled at by Drew.

00:01:48.670 --> 00:01:49.503
- You're the two that are like,

00:01:49.503 --> 00:01:50.590
"Rules are there for a reason.

00:01:50.590 --> 00:01:51.570
That's how we have fun.

00:01:51.570 --> 00:01:54.010
If you don't follow the rules
we can't enjoy ourselves."

00:01:54.010 --> 00:01:54.900
- [Kelly] Okay, that is me. That's me.

00:01:54.900 --> 00:01:56.210
- [Whitney] Yes, I know!

00:01:56.210 --> 00:01:59.220
- We should play a game night together.

00:01:59.220 --> 00:02:00.470
- You will literally kill each other.

00:02:00.470 --> 00:02:01.580
- I love it.

00:02:01.580 --> 00:02:03.065
- We'll be on the same team.

00:02:03.065 --> 00:02:04.715
- I love it. We will destroy you.

